{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364560/extras/b69b03ff9c508dbd0707ec78c7a489b5.poster.avif?t=1751319994\" width=640 height=217 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364560/extras/b69b03ff9c508dbd0707ec78c7a489b5.webm?t=1751319994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rotation Based Precision-Platforming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twist lithely as you hurtle through space, aligning your trajectory to leap perfectly through tiny gaps, lest you fling yourself carelessly into the jagged rocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364560/extras/528a2ea68be4edf35a71884bfac53ce0.webp?t=1751319994\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364560/extras/528a2ea68be4edf35a71884bfac53ce0.poster.avif?t=1751319994\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=96 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tight Single-Screen Chambers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch across rooms, graze past danger, squeeze through passages and bounce frantically between platforms in over 50 of hand-crafted rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364560/extras/d2d51bc28c4a7b01fe17f8128ad9da4b.webp?t=1751319994\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364560/extras/d2d51bc28c4a7b01fe17f8128ad9da4b.poster.avif?t=1751319994\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=128 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Environmental Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim through water, leaping between ponds, drift through void while evading ancient machines, cling to moving platforms, releasing just before they collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364560/extras/c1561daad02ffc7fa2d1089f2ec9f667.webp?t=1751319994\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364560/extras/c1561daad02ffc7fa2d1089f2ec9f667.poster.avif?t=1751319994\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=127 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What else?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 hand-crafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Chapters, each introducing something new</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused, 3-button gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeated death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Below the soil are ruins, below the ruins are tombs, and below the tombs is... a factory.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364560/extras/327dd7d8a3990d3f100940133fad06c9.webp?t=1751319994\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364560/extras/327dd7d8a3990d3f100940133fad06c9.poster.avif?t=1751319994\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=222 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3364560?t=1751319994","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751319994","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364560/923bda07fd8dde58719b63af3be23446e0fb153d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751319994","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364560/923bda07fd8dde